## 7. Limitations

| Limitation | Description | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Training data origin | CNSocialDepress from Weibo (China) | Local validation in Phase 2 |
| Language coverage | Optimised for Mandarin/English | Expand to other APAC languages |
| Platform bias | Social media only | Complement with self-report surveys |
| Digital exclusion | Those without smartphones invisible | Multi-channel data collection |
| Demographic gaps | Limited validation across ethnicities | Stratified validation |
| Temporal drift | Language and slang evolve | Quarterly revalidation |

